  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help develop a Youth Friendly Space in Simonga</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The first Youth Friendly Space (YFS) at Simonga will require the renovation and expansion of a container, where teens and young adults can meet to talk about pressing issues around sexual and reproductive health and positive hygiene practices. The users will have access to a computer for school work and other administrative tasks, as well as a safe space to learn through play and discussion. We intend for the YFS at Simonga to be a centre of excellence and a pilot for future YFS in Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
